The BOHOL custom branded refrigerated vending machine is an OEM/ODM concept for packaged snacks, cans and bottles. The supplied images illustrate a red fruit-themed wrap, mixed-product channels, touchscreen selection, payment modules and optional cooling. They are promotional design references rather than a verified customer installation. Final dimensions, channel capacity, payment hardware, software, temperature range, remote management and production claims must be confirmed in the approved drawing and purchase specification.

For an accurate quotation, provide product samples, target market, local payment-provider requirements, branding artwork, site conditions, cooling target, estimated quantity and acceptance-test expectations.
